[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/30.tres]董卓（仲颖）[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]基本信息：[/color] 约139年生，192年5月22日卒；陇西临洮人（今甘肃岷县）；东汉末年[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "凉州", "cat": "geography"}]凉州[/url][/color]军阀，先后任中郎将、破虏将军、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "并州", "cat": "geography"}]并州[/url][/color]牧、相国、太师；封斄乡侯→郿侯。


[color=#888888]──────────────────────────────[/color]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]生平考证[/font][/b]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]出身与边地生涯[/font][/b]


[indent]•  父董君雅，曾任颍川纶氏尉（微官），据《英雄记》裴注[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  兄董擢字孟高，早卒；弟[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "董旻", "cat": "people"}]董旻[/url][/color]字叔颖[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  少年游历羌中，与诸豪帅结交，宰耕牛宴请；陇西太守辟为郡兵马[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  桓帝末，以六郡良家子为羽林郎，左右驰射，力建战功[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  随中郎将张奂征并州，斩首万余，拜郎中；赐缣九千匹，[color=#000000]尽分吏士[/color]（《魏志》本文）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  历广武令、蜀郡北部都尉、西域戊己校尉，因罪免职[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]凉州平叛与军功积累[/font][/b]


[indent]•  中平元年（184年）讨黄巾，失败，军败抵罪[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  凉州[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "韩遂", "cat": "people"}]韩遂[/url][/color]叛乱，复为中郎将随[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "张温", "cat": "people"}]张温[/url][/color]讨伐[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  六军上陇，五军败绩，[color=#000000]唯独董卓全军而还[/color]（据《三国志》）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  关键战术：截流假装捕鱼，堰水成湖，率军从堤坝下偷渡，决堰后羌追兵无法过河[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  中平五年（188年）封斄乡侯邑千户；与[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "皇甫嵩", "cat": "people"}]皇甫嵩[/url][/color]等大破韩遂，拜前将军，假节[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  中平六年（189年），朝廷征为少府，董卓拒不入京；改拜并州牧，仍拒交出兵权[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]张奂与董卓——最简洁的人品评判[/font][/b]


[indent]•  张奂是董卓早期从军的上司（中郎将，征并州/凉州），董卓以军司马随征，立下大功[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  张奂隐退后，董卓"慕之"，遣兄董擢送缣百匹[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]《后汉书·张奂传》明文：「奂恶卓为人，绝而不受」[/color]——张奂厌恶董卓的整体人品，拒绝礼物，未留文字评价[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  综合解读：张奂识人，知道董卓虽有军事才干和笼络将士之术，但性格残忍贪暴，非可深交之人[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]入京专权（189年）[/font][/b]


[indent]•  大将军[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "何进", "cat": "people"}]何进[/url][/color]召令入京，胁迫太后诛宦官[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  何进被宦官所杀，宦官与[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "袁绍", "cat": "people"}]袁绍[/url][/color]火拼；董卓率步骑三千趁乱入洛阳[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  每晚令士兵出城、次日大张旗鼓入城，制造援军不断到来的假象[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  联合弟董旻、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "吴匡", "cat": "people"}]吴匡[/url][/color]杀[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "何苗", "cat": "people"}]何苗[/url][/color]，招揽[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "吕布", "cat": "people"}]吕布[/url][/color]杀[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "丁原", "cat": "people"}]丁原[/url][/color]，吞并两大军阀兵力[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]废少帝[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘辩", "cat": "people"}]刘辩[/url][/color]为弘农王，立陈留王[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘协", "cat": "people"}]刘协[/url][/color]（汉献帝）[/color][/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]　•  据《三国志》及《后汉书》：与少帝语，"语不可了"；与陈留王语，"自始至终，无所遗失"[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]　•  废帝时，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "卢植", "cat": "people"}]卢植[/url][/color]直言谏阻，引昌邑王先例；[color=#000000]侍中[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "蔡邕", "cat": "people"}]蔡邕[/url][/color]劝止董卓，卢植得免[/color]（《三国志·董卓传》引《献帝纪》）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  派[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "李儒", "cat": "people"}]李儒[/url][/color]鸩杀何太后；后又弑弘农王刘辩（初平元年正月）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  进封相国、太师，僭用天子车服[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]拉拢与任用名士[/font][/b]


[indent]•  为党锢受牵连者（陈蕃、窦武等）平反，收买士族人心[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  任用袁绍为渤海太守，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "韩馥", "cat": "people"}]韩馥[/url][/color]为[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "冀州", "cat": "geography"}]冀州[/url][/color]牧，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "孔伷", "cat": "people"}]孔伷[/url][/color]为豫州刺史——这些人后来全部成为反董主力[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]征用蔡邕[/color]（详见下节）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]蔡邕与董卓——完整往来[/font][/b]


[indent]•  [color=#000000]中平六年（189年）[/color]：董卓为司空，"闻邕名高，辟之，称疾不就。卓大怒，詈曰：'我力能族人，蔡邕遂偃蹇者，不旋踵矣。'又切敕州郡举邕诣府，邕不得已，到"（《后汉书·蔡邕传》）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  入府后受极高礼遇："署祭酒，甚见敬重"，"[color=#000000]三日中遂至尚书[/color]"，此后又拜侍中；至[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "长安", "cat": "geography"}]长安[/url][/color]任左中郎将，封高阳乡侯[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]每有朝廷大事，常令邕起草文书[/color]——蔡邕深度参与董卓政权的文书运转[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]称"尚父"事[/color]：董卓欲称尚父，问蔡邕。邕答以需待关东悉定、车驾东还后议之，董卓接受（《三国志·董卓传》裴注引《献帝纪》）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]地震劝谏[/color]：京师地震，邕答以大臣逾制所致，建议改乘金华皂盖车，卓从之[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]蔡邕之死[/color]：董卓被杀后蔡邕在[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "王允", "cat": "people"}]王允[/url][/color]座上叹惜，王允以"佞臣执笔"为由诛杀——裴松之批评谢承此记为"妄记"[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[color=#000000]结语[/color]：蔡邕与董卓的往来，是威胁迫就仕、厚遇重用、数次婉谏成功的士大夫夹缝生存模式。


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]暴政与迁都[/font][/b]


[indent]•  纵兵劫掠洛阳，强占妇女财物[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  宴请北地反抗者数百人，先断舌、斩手足、凿眼、镬煮，众宾"皆战慑亡失匕箸"（据《后汉书》）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  二月社祭日，出兵屠杀参与百姓[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  初平元年（190年）关东联军起，董卓迁都长安，[color=#000000]焚烧洛阳宫室、宗庙、府库、民宅，发掘帝陵[/color][/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  铸小钱：「坏五铢钱，更铸小钱……货轻而物贵，谷一斛至数十万。」（《三国志·董卓传》）——铸造无重量标准的"小钱"，加之毁铜铸钱，导致恶性通胀；货币崩溃持续至曹魏太和元年（227年）才恢复[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]长安独裁与郿坞[/font][/b]


[indent]•  封郿侯，自封太师，"位在诸侯王上"[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  筑郿坞：高厚仿长安城，积粮三十年，储黄金二三万斤、白银八九万斤（据《英雄记》）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  卫尉张温被诬通[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "袁术", "cat": "people"}]袁术[/url][/color]，笞杀于市[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  朝臣"三公以下皆到卓府议事"；言语不合即被当场杀死[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]被杀（初平三年，192年）[/font][/b]


[indent]•  吕布因与董卓侍婢私通，被董卓掷戟，怀恨；司徒王允以诏书设反间[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  初平三年四月丁巳（192年5月22日），董卓乘车入宫贺献帝病愈，以吕布护驾[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  李肃以戟刺伤手臂，董卓从车坠落；呼吕布，吕布喊"有诏讨贼臣"；骂"庸狗！"，吕布以矛刺杀[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  斩首，弃尸示众；因身体肥胖，士兵在脐眼插灯燃点，"光明数十步"，燃数日[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  "朝野皆相庆贺，百姓歌舞，酒肉满街"[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


